## Main
Let edges be a new Set of (Text, Int, Text).
Add ("a", 1, "b") to edges.
Add ("b", 2, "c") to edges.
Let more be a new Set of (Text, Int, Text).
Add ("b", 2, "c") to more.
Add ("c", 3, "d") to more.
Let all be edges union more.
Show the count of all.
Repeat for (x, w, y) in copy of all:
    If w is greater than 1:
        Add (y, w * 10, x) to all.
Show the count of all.
Show all contains ("d", 30, "c").
Repeat for (x, w, y) in all:
    Show "{x} {w} {y}".
